# SynthLab's FM2 (src/synths/fm2.cpp) rebuilt from the modular catalog, at FM2's default values.
# A modulator Op (Ratio 2) times the index envelope times the velocity's scale moves the carrier Op's phase (Depth = Index, 4 rad).
# The index envelope: FM2's I.Decay (1/e at 300 ms) is a Perc at Curve 100 (-60 dB at its Decay): Decay = 6.9078 x 300 ms.
# The output x 0.5 x (0.3 + 0.7 x velocity), as Basic's.
patch "FM2 (patch)"
node 1 voice Note 16 40
node 2 voice Op 150 20 Ratio=2 Depth=0 Feedback=0 Level=100 Track=1
node 3 voice Perc 150 200 Attack=0 Hold=0 Decay=2072.35 Curve=100 Amount=100
node 4 voice Ring 290 20
node 5 voice Const 16 230 Value=1
node 6 voice Mixer 150 330 Lvl1=70 Lvl2=30 Lvl3=0 Lvl4=0
node 7 voice Ring 430 20
node 8 voice Op 570 20 Ratio=1 Depth=4 Feedback=0 Level=100 Track=1
node 9 voice ADSR 570 200 Attack=2 Decay=1200 Sustain=0 Release=400
node 10 voice VCA 710 20 Level=100
node 11 voice VCA 850 20 Level=50
node 12 voice VoiceOut 990 20 Level=100
cable 2.Out 4.A 1
cable 3.Env 4.B 1
cable 1.Vel 6.In1 1
cable 5.Out 6.In2 1
cable 4.Out 7.A 1
cable 6.Out 7.B 1
cable 7.Out 8.PM 1
cable 8.Out 10.In 1
cable 9.Env 10.CV 1
cable 10.Out 11.In 1
cable 6.Out 11.CV 1
cable 11.Out 12.In 1
